<report>
<title>Agreement</title>

<p>Variables: @tlist</p>
<block name="all">

<p>@{pc:round2}% Limits of agreement = @{from:roundu} to @{to:roundu}</p>
</block>

<p>Intra-class correlation coefficient (one way random effects) = @{icc:roundu}</p>

<p>Estimated within-subjects standard deviation = @{wssd:roundu}</p>

<p>
  For within-subjects sd vs. mean, Kendall's tau @{tau_b_addendum}= @{tau:roundu}  <pval>two sided @{p2:pval}@{low_power_warn}</pval></p>

<p>Repeatability (for alpha = @{pc:round2}) = @{rep:roundu}</p>


<p>@repeatability</p>


<p>@agreement</p>


<p>@qq</p>
</report>
